# Cloudflare Workers Builds (Git) — Dashboard → Worker → Settings → Builds
#
# Do NOT use wrangler pages deploy here: the default build API token only has
# Workers permissions, not Cloudflare Pages Edit.
#
# Build configuration:
#   Build command:   pnpm install && pnpm run build:web:pages
#   Deploy command:  cd apps/desktop && npx wrangler deploy --config wrangler.personal.jsonc
#   Root directory:  /
#   Production branch: web-mobile-pwa
#
# API token (Build settings):
#   Use "Create new token" (Workers Builds auto token) — do not set a custom
#   CLOUDFLARE_API_TOKEN in Variables unless it includes Workers Scripts Edit.
#
# Custom domain (folo.1094712.xyz):
#   Worker → Settings → Domains & routes → Add custom domain
#
# SPA routing is handled by wrangler.personal.jsonc (not_found_handling).
# Do not add public/_redirects with /* /index.html — Workers rejects it as an infinite loop.
#
# Build variables (Settings → Variables and secrets):

NODE_OPTIONS=--max-old-space-size=8192
NODE_VERSION=22
VITE_API_URL=https://folo-api.1094712.xyz
VITE_WEB_URL=https://folo.1094712.xyz
VITE_BUILD_TYPE=production

# Optional:
# VITE_FIREBASE_CONFIG=
# VITE_SENTRY_DSN=
